So each true column of A corresponds to an integer point `u ∈ Z⁵` in the polytope `{10 ≤ Σ_l u_l·Bb[l][i] ≤ 1000, ∀i}`. I'll enumerate all integer points of this 5-dim polytope — hopefully only a handful (the 5 true columns). Let me compute.

